\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -2: Japan Seeking Allies To Prop Up Dollar \b0\par\par\uc2 326 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Juli 2002\par 08:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Japanese officials continued to pitch their view that the weak dollar threatens the global economy. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Masajuro Shiokawa said his ministry's yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday, conducted through the U.S. Federal Reserve and the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , reflected the opinions of foreign central bankers regarding the sliding dollar. \par \par \uc2  "The fall (in the dollar) from Y130-Y131 to Y125 in a span of three, four days, and a further fall below Y120, was excessive for anyone," Shiokawa said. \par \par \uc2  Friday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the seventh by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  since late May, was the first to involve \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  authorities outside Japan. \par \par \uc2  Although the U.S. and European central banks didn't add their own funds to the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the coordinated action was seen as an effort to show that Japan isn't alone in its fight against dollar bears. \par \par \uc2  Administrative Vice Finance Minister Toshiro Mutoh said Monday the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was "a step forward" for Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy - perhaps a hint to markets to expect more such cooperation in the future. \par \par \uc2  But later in the day U.S. Treasury Secretary Paul O'Neill downplayed Friday's move, emphasizing that the Fed had merely facilitated the yen-selling. He said he remained "agnostic" on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  generally. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  needs a strong dollar to fuel its vital export industries. But Japanese officials, it seems, have a long way to go before they convince the rest of the world to close ranks behind the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  -By Jonathan Soble, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; jonathan.soble@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  The chart of late Tokyo \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates that accompanied Asia \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been replaced with an enhanced \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixture that is updated hourly. \par \par \uc2  Subscribers can find this table: \par \par \uc2  -On Telerate pages 4046 and 1087. \par \par \uc2  -On Dow Jones Newswires by searching the code N/IFX \par \par \uc2  -On Reuters by entering FRX or INT \par \par \uc2  -On Bloomberg by entering NI FRX \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020702dy72000bz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
