re not concerned about recent rise in euro, dealers added. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020701dy71002gy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
