\par\par \b \uc2  Asian gold up in afternoon,Dow loss adds momentum. \b0\par\par\uc2 590 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Juni 2002\par 08:42\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  HONG KONG, June 26 (Reuters) - After bolting to the US$323 level at the open, spot gold advanced cautiously in nervous trade in Asia on Wednesday, and dealers forecast more volatility, possibly in a higher band later in European trade. \par \par \uc2  "The market is volatile and nervous. People are not sure what is going to happen...but I don't think this news about WorldCom has changed anything," said Greg Fan, dealer at NM Rothschild in Hong Kong. \par \par \uc2  "Funds are quite long in gold. I don't think this can push us higher before a good consolidation," Fan said. \par \par \uc2  Spot gold was trading at US$323.30/3.80 an ounce at 0555 GMT, up from the open in Hong Kong at US$322.30/2.80 and New York's last indicated US$320.30/0.80. \par \par \uc2  WorldCom Inc , the No. 2 U.S. long-distance telecommunications carrier, reported after the close of the stock exchange on Tuesday that it had fired its chief financial officer after uncovering improper accounting for almost $4 billion in expenses. \par \par \uc2  This news, more evidence of U.S. corporate gamesmanship, was expected to send the Dow Jones Industrial Average sliding again when the market opened on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The Dow Jones Industrial Average rallied in the first part of the day on the release of positive U.S. economic data, and gold conversely sank to a low of US$317. \par \par \uc2  But after the close of trading on COMEX, concerns about the profitability of some leading U.S. companies, sent the Dow skidding to a sharply lower close, down another 1.67 percent to 9,126.82. \par \par \uc2  Early trading in Sydney saw U.S.-based funds buying gold and lifting it US$3.00. \par \par \uc2  "It is the same old story. We are just following through on what happened in New York last night," said Peter Tse, senior dealer at Scotia Mocatta in Hong Kong. \par \par \uc2  Technically, the market could be said to be trading in a broader range now. \par \par \uc2  "I think downside is still US$316-317 and upside is at US$326-327," Fan said. \par \par \uc2  Options expiry could also be stimulating trade and producing some of the volatility seen in the past two days. dealers in Sydney said. \par \par \uc2  Exchange rate fluctuations, in particular the dollar's recent weak trend against the Japanese yen and the euro have been the major force pushing gold higher in recent weeks. \par \par \uc2  TOCOM April 2003 was trading 13 yen lower at 1,250 yen on heavy trade of 76,280 contracts, taking relatively little notice of the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The Japanese yen climbed to a day high of 120.18 yen to the dollar, before the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ), the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the second this week, appeared to briefly halt the yen's appreciation, but not change the overall trend, thus indicating lower TOCOM gold prices, if not higher U.S. dollar gold as well, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Hong Kong tael gold , which is traded on the Chinese Gold and Silver Exchange, ended the morning session at HK$3,005 a tael, higher than the open at HK$2,991. A tael is equal to 1.203 ounces of gold. \par \par \uc2  Kilogold ended the morning unchanged at HK$80.75 a gramme. \par \par \uc2  Spot silver marched higher to US$4.87/4.89 an ounce, up from the open at US$4.84/4.86 an ounce. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020626dy6q00dg2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
